# --- L2 #28 hygiene baseline (added 2026-06-11) ---
# .gitignore — Phenotype org canonical (L2 #28)
# Source of truth: phenotype-org-governance/.gitignore
# Ship to all focus repos by MERGE (idempotent: appending any missing entries
# under the marker block; never overwriting repo-specific lines above).
#
# Merge marker:
#   # --- L2 #28 hygiene baseline (added 2026-06-11) ---
#
# When shipping to a focus repo, this block is appended only if a line from
# the canonical (below) is not already covered by an existing rule. The merge
# preserves all repo-specific lines and is safe to re-run.


# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.pdb

# Go build artifacts
**/go-build/

# Python build artifacts
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/env/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/*.egg-info/
**/.eggs/

# Node / TypeScript
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/
**/.cache/
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# macOS / OS
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
**/desktop.ini

# Editors / IDE

# Logs / temp
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# Env / secrets (local-only; commit .env.example)
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env.*.local

# Worktree / agent caches
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
.serena/
.codex/
.cursor/
